WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.292
The paper makes four moves.

00:00:03.372 --> 00:00:06.664
First,

00:00:06.744 --> 00:00:10.036
it proves that at initialisation a multilayer
perceptron and its Jacobian jointly converge

00:00:10.116 --> 00:00:13.409
to a zero-mean Gaussian process,

00:00:13.489 --> 00:00:16.781
and it writes down that limiting kernel, the
Jacobian NNGP kernel,

00:00:16.861 --> 00:00:20.153
inductively over depth.

00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:23.525
Second, it defines a Jacobian Neural Tangent
Kernel, the JNTK,

00:00:23.605 --> 00:00:26.897
and proves it becomes deterministic at
initialisation and then stays constant throughout

00:00:26.977 --> 00:00:30.269
robust training as width grows.

00:00:30.349 --> 00:00:33.641
Third, because the kernel is constant,

00:00:33.721 --> 00:00:37.014
the training dynamics collapse to a linear
first-order differential equation whose infinite-time

00:00:37.094 --> 00:00:40.386
solution is a plain kernel regressor.

00:00:40.466 --> 00:00:43.758
And fourth,

00:00:43.838 --> 00:00:47.130
it validates all of this empirically and uses the
solution to study when accuracy and robustness go together.
